<p class="fine">This is a value comparison, not a guarantee of a good trade. Demand, duped status and personal preference matter too.</p></section></div>
<section class="panel" id="about" style="margin-top:16px"><h2>About the data</h2><p class="fine">Jailbreak Values is an independent fan project. The listed vehicle values were transcribed from the JB Values index checked on November 1, 2026. JB Values says its value team reviews market activity and approves value changes. This prototype is a static snapshot and does not automatically sync with JB Values.</p><p class="fine">Jailbreak Values is not affiliated with Roblox, Badimo or JB Values. JB Values is credited as the reference source.</p><a href="https://jbvalues.com/faq" target="_blank" rel="noopener">How JB Values determines values ↗</a></section>
